{"call_id":"call_RjUgZQ57444BtZhBEqiqjDEb","process_id":"86652","turn_id":"019ca75c-4080-7a22-a72e-400c8537695b","command":["/usr/bin/bash","-lc","kspec task get @01KJDQ1G6 --json"],"cwd":"/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"kspec task get @01KJDQ1G6 --json"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","stdout":"{\n  \"_ulid\": \"01KJDQ1G6HBSJRXVSWEWQ9W9E4\",\n  \"slugs\": [],\n  \"title\": \"Web UI triage page: add filter controls for triage action types (promote, delete, defer, spec-gap, d\",\n  \"type\": \"task\",\n  \"description\": \"Web UI triage page: add filter controls for triage action types (promote, delete, defer, spec-gap, duplicate). Currently no way to filter triage records by action.\",\n  \"spec_ref\": \"@interactive-triage-ui\",\n  \"status\": \"needs_work\",\n  \"blocked_by\": [],\n  \"depends_on\": [],\n  \"context\": [],\n  \"priority\": 3,\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"vcs_refs\": [],\n  \"session_id\": null,\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T19:33:03.825Z\",\n  \"started_at\": \"2026-03-01T02:46:20.462Z\",\n  \"submitted_at\": \"2026-03-01T02:57:17.878Z\",\n  \"notes\": [\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJDQBJ4QTDMCZJ4NAY7B1KGP\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T19:38:33.495Z\",\n      \"author\": \"@claude\",\n      \"content\": \"ENRICHMENT — Standalone context for this task:\\n\\n**What**: The triage page has status and tag filters (lines 326-347 of `packages/web-ui/src/routes/triage/+page.svelte`) but no way to filter triage records by their action type (promote, delete, defer, spec-gap, duplicate). When reviewing triage history, users often want to see \\\"all promote decisions\\\" or \\\"all spec-gap findings\\\" without scrolling through mixed results.\\n\\n**Where**: `packages/web-ui/src/routes/triage/+page.svelte`:\\n- Existing filters: `filterStatus` (all/untriaged/triaged/acted_on) at line 44, `filterTag` at line 43\\n- Filter UI: lines 324-347 (the filter controls div with data-testid=\\\"triage-filters\\\")\\n- Filtered items computation: `filteredItems` derived at lines 78-96 — currently filters by tag and status only\\n- The `TriageAction` type includes: promote, delete, defer, spec-gap, duplicate (defined in `$lib/types/triage`)\\n\\n**How**:\\n1. Add a new `filterAction` state variable: `let filterAction = $state<TriageAction | ''>('')`\\n2. Add a new `<select>` element in the filters div (alongside status and tag filters) with options for each action type\\n3. Add action filtering to the `filteredItems` derived computation:\\n   ```\\n   if (filterAction) {\\n     items = items.filter((i) => i.record?.action === filterAction);\\n   }\\n   ```\\n4. Include the action filter in the `$effect` that resets `currentIndex` when filters change (line 296-302)\\n5. If implementing URL state persistence (task @01KJDQ1F), also sync this filter to URL params\\n\\n**Done when**:\\n- A dropdown/select control for triage action type appears in the filter bar\\n- Selecting \\\"promote\\\" shows only items with promote decisions\\n- Selecting \\\"spec-gap\\\" shows only spec-gap items\\n- The empty/default option shows all items (no action filter)\\n- Changing the filter resets the card navigation index to 0\\n- E2E test covers filtering by action type\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJDQWRKV7J9BSC3BY2NNPNG8\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T19:47:57.179Z\",\n      \"author\": \"@claude\",\n      \"content\": \"Linked to @interactive-triage-ui spec. Add filter controls for triage action types on triage page.\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJKMNG3VF2TXPKYDBZC72JTD\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T02:46:59.963Z\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n      \"content\": \"Implemented triage action-filter support in web UI scope for @interactive-triage-ui ac-7.\\n\\nChanges in progress:\\n- Added action filter state (`filterAction`) and filtering logic in `packages/web-ui/src/routes/triage/+page.svelte` so cards can be filtered by triage decision action.\\n- Added action filter `<select>` UI (`data-testid=\\\"triage-action-filter\\\"`) using existing ACTION_LABELS.\\n- Included action filter in the index-reset effect so changing filters returns card navigation to index 0.\\n- Added E2E coverage in `packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/triage.spec.ts` for control visibility and behavior (action filter narrows results and resets card index).\\n\\nNext: run targeted E2E and validation checks, then full test suite before submit.\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJKN5GXGSEWEQNXEDV71W02R\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T02:55:45.072Z\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n      \"content\": \"Verification summary after implementation:\\n\\n- Targeted AC-7 E2E checks pass:\\n  - `npm run build && npx playwright test tests/e2e/triage.spec.ts -g \\\"displays filter controls and progress count|action filter narrows cards by triage action and resets card index\\\"`\\n  - Result: 2 passed.\\n- Full triage.spec run still has pre-existing failures unrelated to this change (real-time progress assertion and submit-enabled expectation paths).\\n- Full repo test run has a pre-existing failing file:\\n  - `tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts` (3 timeout failures at lines 34, 70, 104).\\n- `kspec validate` still fails with pre-existing project-wide schema/reference/alignment/completeness issues (missing observations skill file, duplicate @observations slug, many baseline alignment warnings).\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJKN8H59YH4Y0DZ330GFE5AD\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T02:57:23.625Z\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n      \"content\": \"Submitted for review in PR #619: https://github.com/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pull/619 (branch feat/triage-action-filter, commit e8371171a). Implemented triage action filter UI + logic and AC-7 E2E coverage updates.\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJKNQV0D9G4KCZETEV1H6RPX\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T03:05:45.229Z\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n      \"content\": \"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: MUST-FIX: New AC-7 action-filter E2E test is failing (packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/triage.spec.ts:167, page.reload ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED). PR #619 reviewed and commented inline; worker should stabilize this test and resubmit.\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"todos\": [],\n  \"automation\": \"eligible\",\n  \"_sourceFile\": \"/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml\",\n  \"inherited_traits\": [\n    {\n      \"ref\": \"@trait-websocket-protocol\",\n      \"title\": \"WebSocket Protocol Patterns\",\n      \"acceptance_criteria\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ac-1\",\n          \"given\": \"WebSocket connection is established\",\n          \"when\": \"client connects\",\n          \"then\": \"server assigns unique connection ID and sends connected event with session_id\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ac-2\",\n          \"given\": \"client wants notifications\",\n          \"when\": \"subscribe command sent with topics array\",\n          \"then\": \"server tracks subscription and sends ack with request_id\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ac-3\",\n          \"given\": \"client is subscribed to topic\",\n          \"when\": \"relevant change occurs\",\n          \"then\": \"server broadcasts event with format {msg_id, seq, timestamp, topic, event, data}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ac-4\",\n          \"given\": \"WebSocket connection is active\",\n          \"when\": \"30 seconds pass without activity\",\n          \"then\": \"server sends ping frame\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ac-5\",\n          \"given\": \"ping was sent\",\n          \"when\": \"no pong received within 90 seconds\",\n          \"then\": \"connection is closed with code 1001\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ac-6\",\n          \"given\": \"server sends events\",\n          \"when\": \"client cannot keep up (backpressure)\",\n          \"then\": \"server pauses non-critical broadcasts until drain event\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ac-7\",\n          \"given\": \"connection is closing\",\n          \"when\": \"close initiated\",\n          \"then\": \"use code 1000 for clean close, 1001 for timeout, 1011 for error\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"ac-8\",\n          \"given\": \"client reconnects after disconnect\",\n          \"when\": \"new connection established\",\n          \"then\": \"client resets sequence tracking (lastSeqProcessed = -1) since server generates new sequence\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"_ulid\": \"01KJDQ1G6HBSJRXVSWEWQ9W9E4\",\n  \"slugs\": [],\n  \"title\": \"Web UI triage page: add filter controls for triage action types (promote, delete, defer, spec-gap, d\",\n  \"type\": \"task\",\n  \"description\": \"Web UI triage page: add filter controls for triage action types (promote, delete, defer, spec-gap, duplicate). Currently no way to filter triage records by action.\",\n  \"spec_ref\": \"@interactive-triage-ui\",\n  \"status\": \"needs_work\",\n  \"blocked_by\": [],\n  \"depends_on\": [],\n  \"context\": [],\n  \"priority\": 3,\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"vcs_refs\": [],\n  \"session_id\": null,\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T19:33:03.825Z\",\n  \"started_at\": \"2026-03-01T02:46:20.462Z\",\n  \"submitted_at\": \"2026-03-01T02:57:17.878Z\",\n  \"notes\": [\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJDQBJ4QTDMCZJ4NAY7B1KGP\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T19:38:33.495Z\",\n      \"author\": \"@claude\",\n      \"content\": \"ENRICHMENT — Standalone context for this task:\\n\\n**What**: The triage pag